  "description": "MEJGEQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H60 Dy4 N8 O22. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.456-3.856 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.80-110.68°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C62H60Dy4N8O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
